WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:05,070
I can only tell you one thing, boy

2
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,830
Your father is such a stingy person

3
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,550
Trying my best to get you down the mountain

4
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,230
Let you be targeted by 749ju

5
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:12,190
Even let you sign this contract

6
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,630
He asked you to come here

7
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,310
Definitely not just for

8
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:17,110
It’s so easy to save tuition for your sophomore year

9
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,860
No tuition fee

10
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,510
What else could it be for?

11
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:23,100
Is it to sell me to the country for money?

12
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:31,140
Hello, who is this?

13
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,500
If you ask me to tell your fortune

14
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,540
Price starts at three hundred

15
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:34,520
Dare to know

16
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,560
In the end, stop pretending it's me

17
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,050
Give me a sneak peek

18
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:41,290
Did you come to 749 House twenty years ago?

19
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:42,610
What are you hiding from me?

20
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:46,030
The work efficiency is quite high

21
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:47,710
This was incorporated by the state

22
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:50,090
Don't worry about whether it's a secret or not.
